# RecursiveMAS MK2

RecursiveMAS_MK2 is an extension of the Recursive_MAS paper. I plan to do two things:
- Extend the paper to use bigger models and see if the results can be reproduced
- If the above is successful, I also plan to check if the method given by the paper can work on multiple multi-tiered system (MAS) or only a single MAS.
